msgid "Founder of Weblate"
msgstr "Osnivač Weblatea"

msgid ""
"Michal is a libre software enthusiast born and residing in Prague, Czech "
"Republic. He is a long term contributor to various libre software projects "
"like <a href=\"https://weblate.org/\">Weblate</a>, <a href=\"https://"
"wammu.eu/\">Gammu</a>, <a href=\"https://www.phpmyadmin.net/\">phpMyAdmin</"
"a> and <a href=\"https://www.debian.org/\">Debian</a>."
msgstr ""
"Michal je entuzijast po pitanju slobodnog softvera. Rođen je i živi u Pragu, "
"Češka Republika. Dugoročni je doprinositelj raznim projektima slobodnog "
"softvera kao što su <a href=\"https://weblate.org/\">Weblate</a>, <a "
"href=\"https://wammu.eu/\">Gammu</a>, <a href=\"https://www.phpmyadmin.net/"
"\">phpMyAdmin</a> i <a href=\"https://www.debian.org/\">Debian</a>."

msgid ""
"After employment in several technology companies, since early 2016, Michal "
"dedicated himself to providing services to companies focusing on "
"localization and Weblate."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što je bio zaposlen u raznim tehnološkim poduzećima, Michal se je "
"početkom 2016. godine posvetio pružanju usluga poduzećima s naglaskom na "
"lokalizaciju i Weblate."

