msgid "Found a <strong>bug</strong> in Weblate?"
msgstr "<strong>Greška</strong> u Weblateu?"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"In case it is sensitive or a <strong>security issue</strong>, please report "
"it to %(report)s. Other ways of reporting security issue can be found in the "
"<a href=\"%(url)s\">documentation</a>."
msgstr ""
"U slučaju da se radi o osjetljivom ili <strong>sigurnosnom problemu</"
"strong>, prijavi ga na %(report)s. Ostali načini prijavljivanja sigurnosnih "
"problema navedeni su u <a href=\"%(url)s\">dokumentaciji</a>."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"<strong>Ensure the bug is not already reported</strong>, by searching "
"through the <a href=\"%(url)s\">GitHub issues</a>."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Provjeri je li greška već prijavljena</strong>, pretraživanjem <a "
"href=\"%(url)s\">problema na GitHub-u</a>."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"If you're unable to find an open issue addressing the problem, <a "
"href=\"%(url)s\">open a new one</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ako ne možeš pronaći prijavljeni problem koji rješava tvoj problem, <a "
"href=\"%(url)s\">prijavi novi problem</a>."

msgid ""
"<strong>Follow instructions in the issue template</strong>, and provide as "
"much relevant info as possible."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Slijedi upute u predlošku za probleme</strong> i navedi što više "
"relevantnih podataka."

